---
// FieldGauge: the scroll indicator on the field's right edge (Design 02).
// The track and the thumb are aria-hidden: the status strip's count is the
// accessible reading. The thumb is sized by the field script.
---

<div class="field-gauge" data-gauge aria-hidden="true">
	<span class="field-gauge__thumb" data-gauge-thumb></span>
</div>
